OL,3,GNEWSARugby star is 'Sussex girl through
OL,4,Aand through'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland rugby player Jess Breach says
OL,7,Fshe is "a Sussex girl through and
OL,8,Fthrough" and is excited to get going
OL,9,Fwith the new Premiership Women's Rugby
OL,10,F(PWR) season.
OL,12,FBreach grew up in Chichester and played
OL,13,Ffor Chichester RFC in her youth. She
OL,14,Fnow plays for North London side
OL,15,FSaracens.
OL,17,FThe winger made her 50th England
OL,18,Fappearance during last summer's Women's
OL,19,FRugby World Cup at the Amex stadium in
OL,20,FBrighton, calling it "a full circle
OL,21,Fmoment".
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
